  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tTime and Fees\n\t\tTime and Fees\n\n### Time and Fees: Time (Manager Access)\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 25 Sep, 2024 at  2:54 PM\n\n\t\tThis article will provide a step by step guide on how to log, add and edit the time spent on a particular task specifically for manager users.\n\nRemember as managers you are responsible for what the admin has given you access to view and approve.\n\nAdd time:\n\nNavigation: Time and Fees > Timelog > +Time \n\nTo add time you can include the following:\n\nJob ID\n\nClient\n\nTask\n\nSubtask\n\nUser\n\nDate \n\nTime spent\n\nDescription\n\nOnce saved, it will create a new timelog and that will be stored in the unsubmitted section.\n\nUnsubmitted:\n\nThe unsubmitted records will be stored here \n\nIn order to submit for approval, you have to hover over the unsubmitted time log and click ‘submit for approval’.\n\nYou can also send reminders here too.\n\nPFA: Pending for Approval:\n\nOnce you submit for approval it will be in the PFA section and you can bulk approve/ reject within here. \n\nApproved:\n\nThis then moves into the approved section, which can be seen above and if for any reason you may need to withdraw approval you are able to do this by clicking on ‘withdraw approval’. \n\nOnce you withdraw it moves this back into the unsubmitted section. \n\nRejected:\n\nThis section contains the rejected time logs, if you need to withdraw the rejection hover over the time log and click ‘withdraw rejection’.\n\nYou can also do this in bulk by clicking on all the time logs you need to withdraw rejection for. \n\nNavigation: Time and Fees > Time > +Add Time > Day\n\nAfter adding a job the day view is shown and you can edit the time by clicking inside the time.\n\nAfter adding a job the day view is shown and you can edit the time by clicking inside the time\n\nYou can edit the job after creating it by clicking by clicking on the specific job\n\nYou can also save and submit for approval here\n\nNavigation: Time and Fees > Time > +Add Time > Week\n\nBy toggling to the week view you can select a specific week to view on the calendar.\n\nYou can use the 3 dots on the right hand side to copy previous tasks into the following week.\n\nIf you encounter any issues or require further assistance, don't hesitate to reach out to your Onboarding Manager.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118370\">Time and Fees</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000199496\">Time and Fees</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Time and Fees: Time (Manager Access)\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 25 Sep, 2024 at  2:54 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">This article will provide a step by step guide on how to log, add and edit the time spent on a particular task specifically for manager users.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><div style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 41.25%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/7d07b85af07446a7b9b67eee8c7577ab?sid=095eced3-ad15-4720-b155-e71d070de0da\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></div><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Remember as managers you are responsible for what the admin has given you access to view and approve.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Add time:</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Navigation: Time and Fees &gt; Timelog &gt; +Time&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:677px;height:309px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9204748138/original/A3yOShKe99FE0o64t8mGwlULmewstuFdXA.png?1706876091\" width=\"677\" height=\"309\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9204748138\"></span></span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">To add time you can include the following:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Job ID</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Client</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Task</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Subtask</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">User</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Date&nbsp;</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Time spent</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Description</span></p></li></ul><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.656; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Once&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">saved</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">, it will create a new timelog and that will be stored in the unsubmitted section.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Unsubmitted:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:602px;height:272px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9204748135/original/1Nr1sGnPH9Dmo2DzBsl4ybukELJm6POyyQ.png?1706876090\" width=\"602\" height=\"272\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9204748135\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">The unsubmitted records will be stored here&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">In order to submit for approval, you have to hover over the unsubmitted time log and click ‘submit for approval’.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">You can also send reminders here too.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">PFA: Pending for Approval:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:602px;height:273px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9204748136/original/1CQaGiFTBHwKN9VXpXI-K7WgtYaGtuR_SQ.png?1706876090\" width=\"602\" height=\"273\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9204748136\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Once you submit for approval it will be in the PFA section and you can bulk approve/ reject within here.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Approved:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:602px;height:272px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9204748137/original/G6oPgKw-dYKtiSlvAqkPmnGkmlvzdEP1zQ.png?1706876090\" width=\"602\" height=\"272\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9204748137\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">This then moves into the approved section, which can be seen above and if for any reason you may need to withdraw approval you are able to do this by clicking on ‘withdraw approval’.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Once you withdraw it moves this back into the unsubmitted section.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Rejected:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:602px;height:271px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9204748139/original/KnwhMhz-wWWMhGSJE4kRveHBnxyAMsoitg.png?1706876091\" width=\"602\" height=\"271\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9204748139\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">This section contains the rejected time logs, if you need to withdraw the rejection hover over the time log and click ‘withdraw rejection’.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">You can also do this in bulk by clicking on all the time logs you need to withdraw rejection for.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Navigation: Time and Fees &gt; Time &gt; +Add Time &gt; Day</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">After adding a job the day view is shown and you can edit the time by clicking inside the time.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:602px;height:272px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9204748140/original/yHenhcIR0BANij7XW3JGi3BlmUZ_fQh_FQ.png?1706876091\" width=\"602\" height=\"272\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9204748140\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">After adding a job the day view is shown and you can edit the time by clicking inside the time</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">You can edit the job after creating it by clicking by clicking on the specific job</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">You can also save and submit for approval here</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Navigation: Time and Fees &gt; Time &gt; +Add Time &gt; Week</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:602px;height:269px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9204748141/original/H2zKmzOSnuSXgcW0cDJdVsZlv-J7ifYiRA.png?1706876091\" width=\"602\" height=\"269\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9204748141\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">By toggling to the week view you can select a specific week to view on the calendar.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">You can use the 3 dots on the right hand side to copy previous tasks into the following week.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">If you encounter any issues or require further assistance, don't hesitate to reach out to your Onboarding Manager.</span></p><p 